WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.595
Team sanctions are under each team: "Improper request" and "Delay warning".

2
00:00:02.645 --> 00:00:06.915
Improper request: tap it, then "Yes".

3
00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:11.196
A delay: "Delay warning", then "Yes".

4
00:00:11.246 --> 00:00:16.851
The next delay is a "Delay penalty": a point for the other team.

5
00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.582
A player: tap the player, then "Sanction".

6
00:00:20.632 --> 00:00:24.670
"Warning", "Penalty", "Expulsion" or "Disqualification".

7
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.762
Check the player, then "Confirm".

8
00:00:27.812 --> 00:00:34.812
A "Penalty" also gives the other team a point.

9
00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:43.465
"Expulsion" or "Disqualification": the player leaves. Choose who comes in.

10
00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:55.377
"Match" → "Show sanctions and results" lists every sanction.
